menu "IT9507 DVB-T modulator"

config IT9507_SKIP_FIRMWARE_UPLOAD
    bool "Skip firmware upload on open"
    default n
    help
        When enabled the driver will not upload the MCU firmware blob
        when it9507_open() is called.

        Note: the IT9507 is RAM-only; it loses its firmware whenever USB
        power is removed. Only enable this if you are certain the device
        was already initialised in the current power session and you do
        not want to re-upload (e.g. you are restarting the ESP32 while
        the USB stick remains powered and warm).

endmenu
